// square with its name underneath. Brand shapes come from Simple Icons (CC0)
// and keep their own colours; Rive and Maze follow the text colour. The brands are
// trademarks of their owners. It renders a list item; pass `as="div"` to use
// it outside a list, like the About page's tool cards. `learning` pins the
// same yellow "Learning" tag the About page's toolkit uses to the box corner.
